  "translation": [
    "Today is Sunday, and I went to the shopping mall with my older brother. My brother is three years older than me, and he is also taller than me. He wanted to buy a new piece of clothing.",
    "There were a lot of people in the mall. The red clothes were more expensive than the black ones, but my brother thought the red ones looked better than the black ones. He asked me, \"What do you think?\" I said, \"It looks great!\"",
